# FAQ

How do I change what a bot does? Edit its Instructions on the bot page.
INSTRUCTIONS apply to every run. Instructions are versioned.
Where are the Tico docs? Open Tico docs from the side bar.
Work goes through Tico on your computer, so Through Tico is how a bot reaches GitHub.
The Computer pulls updates from the repository before each run. The Computer syncs `AGENT.md` before the next run.
The Computer syncs the repo; then the bot starts its run.

Our company keeps its washing machine and coworkers; keep `standing instructions` in code.
